+#if MSAA_SAMPLES > 1
+	// s29 w1-text-pixels PROTOTYPE (tf_cpu_cov_fill): Flash keeps the skewed
+	// box UNSIZE-SNAPPED (the shear edge's 2-row period = slope 0.5 exactly,
+	// not Ruffle's rint(27.5 - 0.35) = 27 / 55) and rounds its corners to
